{"id":"H5832","lemma":"עֲזַרְאֵל","transliteration":"azarel","sayIt":"a-zar-EL","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Azarel","meaning":"A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.12.6\n§ Azarael or Azareel = \"God has helped\"\n1) a Korhite warrior of David who joined him at Ziklag\n2) a Levite musician of the family of Heman in the time of David\n3) a Danite, son of Jeroham and a prince of the tribe at the census of David\n4) one of the sons of Bani who took a foreign wife in the time of Ezra\n5) a priest, ancestor of Maasiai or Amashai, a priest in Jerusalem after the return from exile\n6) a priest and musician in the time of Nehemiah","glosses":["azarel","son"],"count":6,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-12","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Azarel","kjv":"and Azareel"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-25","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"to Azarel","kjv":"to Azareel"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-27","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"was Azarel","kjv":"Azareel"}},{"chapterId":"ezr-10","v":41,"renderings":{"bsb":"Azarel","kjv":"Azareel"}},{"chapterId":"neh-11","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"the son","kjv":"of Azareel"}},{"chapterId":"neh-12","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"Azarel","kjv":"and Azarael"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 12:6","note":"Elkanah, Isshiah Azarel, Joezer, and Jashobeam, the Korahites;","source":"web"},{"ref":"Ezra 10:41","note":"Azarel, and Shelemiah, Shemariah,","source":"web"},{"ref":"Nehemiah 11:13","note":"and his brothers, chiefs of fathers’ households, two hundred forty-two; and Amashsai the son of Azarel, the son of Ahzai, the son of Meshillemoth, the son of…","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H2607","lemma":"חֲנָנִי","transliteration":"chanani","gloss":"Hanani"},{"id":"H5717","lemma":"עֲדִיאֵל","transliteration":"adiel","gloss":"Adiel"},{"id":"H5816","lemma":"עֻזִּיאֵל","transliteration":"uzziel","gloss":"Uzziel"},{"id":"H1562","lemma":"גִּלֲלַי","transliteration":"gilalay","gloss":"Gilalai"},{"id":"H2148","lemma":"זְכַרְיָהוּ","transliterat